       Identification Division.                                         00010000
       Program-ID. F115IRP0.                                            00020000
       Author.  Henning Langfeldt Rødland.                              00030000
      *################################################################*00040000
      *                                                                 00050000
      * FD Trade Finance                                                00060000
      *                                                                 00070000
      * Interface for all database access on table TF_Related_Party.    00080000
      *                                                                 00090000
      * The interface kan read one spesific occurence,                  00100000
      * or several occurences, fully or partly qualified with           00110000
      * from- and to- values.                                           00120000
      *                                                                 00130000
      * When reading several occurences, one must always start with     00140000
      * -In-Get-1st, and continue with -In-Get-Next.                    00150000
      *                                                                 00160000
      * NB!  There are several key-fields, which may be used            00170000
      *      differently depending on the need.                         00180000
      *      See seperate description below.                            00190000
      *                                                                 00200000
      *                                                                 00210000
      * An ordinary Select call may look like this:                     00220019
      *                                                                 00230019
      *    Initialize                          R115IRP0-Related-Party   00240019
      *    Set   R115IRP0-Version        To    True                     00250019
      *    Set   R115IRP0-In-Select      To    True                     00260019
      *                                                                 00270019
      * One of these:                                                   00280035
      * 1) Set   R115IRP0-In-Actual      To    True                     00290035
      * 2) Set   R115IRP0-In-Work        To    True                     00300035
      *                                                                 00310035
      * One of these:                                                   00320019
      * 1) Move  &fin-inst-id            To    R115IRP0-In-Fin-Inst-ID  00330019
      * 2) Move  &fin-inst-no            To    R115IRP0-In-Fin-Inst-No  00340019
      *                                                                 00350019
      *    Move  &contract-type          To    R115IRP0-In-Contract-Type00360019
      *    Move  &contract-no            To    R115IRP0-In-Contract-No  00370019
      *    Move  &role-type              To    R115IRP0-In-Role-Type    00380019
      *                                                                 00390019
      * To specify relation to Main_Contract or Part_Amount:            00400019
      * One of these: (3rd only for cursors)                            00410019
      * 1) Set   R115IRP0-In-Rel-MC      To    True                     00420019
      * 2) Set   R115IRP0-In-Rel-PA      To    True                     00430019
      * 3) Set   R115IRP0-In-Rel-All     To    True                     00440019
      *                                                                 00450019
      * If you want Related Party for a Part_Amount, fill in these:     00460019
      *    Move  &currency (ISO 4217)    To    R115IRP0-In-CA-Currency  00470019
      *    Move  &part-amount seq.no     To    R115IRP0-In-PA-Seq-No    00480019
      *                                                                 00490019
      *    Call  'F115IRP0'              Using R115IRP0-Related-Party   00500000
      *                                        R7919999-Error-Area      00510000
      *    End-Call                                                     00520000
      *                                                                 00530000
      *    Evaluate True                                                00540000
      *      When R7919999-Return-Abend                                 00550000
      *        Move  '&&&&'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       00560000
      *        Perform Z900-Abend                                       00570000
      *                                                                 00580000
      *      When R7919999-Return-Error                                 00590000
      *        ...not found...                                          00600000
      *                                                                 00610000
      *      When R7919999-Return-OK                                    00620000
      *        ...found...                                              00630000
      *                                                                 00640000
      *    End-Evaluate                                                 00650000
      *                                                                 00660000
      *################################################################*00670000
