      *################################################################.02720000
       Procedure Division                Using L-Ext-IO-Area            02730000
                                               R7919999-Error-Area.     02740000
      *                                                                 02750000
       A000-Main                         Section.                       02760000
      *                                                                 02770000
           Perform B000-Initialize                                      02780000
      *                                                                 02790000
           Evaluate True                                                02800000
             When SW-IA-Initialize                                      02810000
               Continue                                                 02820000
      *                                                                 02830000
