      *################################################################*02920000
       B000-Initialize                   Section.                       02930000
      *                                                                 02940000
           Set   R7919999-Return-OK      To    True                     02950000
      *                                                                 02960000
           Evaluate True                                                02970000
             When L-Ext-IO-Area (1:10)   =     'INITIALIZE'             02980000
               Set   Sw-IA-Initialize    To    True                     02990000
             When Other                                                 03000000
               Move  Space               To    W-Input-Action           03010000
           End-Evaluate                                                 03020000
      *                                                                 03030000
           Compute  W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab                                    03040000
               =    Length               Of    WS-DB2-Table             03050000
               /    Length               Of    WS-DB2-Row               03060000
