      *################################################################.04320000
       D100-Prepare-Input                Section.                       04330000
      *                                                                 04340000
      * We create internal from- and to-values, depending on the input. 04350000
      *                                                                 04360000
           Initialize                          WE-Cursor-Info           04370000
      *                                                                 04380000
           Move  R115IRP0-In-Fin-Inst-ID To    WE-Fin-Inst-ID           04390000
           Move  R115IRP0-In-Fin-Inst-No To    WE-Fin-Inst-No           04400000
      *                                                                 04410000
           Move  R115IRP0-In-Contract-Type                              04420000
                                         To    WE-Contract-Type         04430000
      *    Move  +0                      To    W-Tally                  04440049
      *    Inspect WE-Contract-Type     Tallying W-Tally for all '*' '%'04450049
      *    If  W-Tally                   >     +0                       04460049
      *        Inspect WE-Contract-Type  Converting '* ' to '%%'        04470049
      *    End-If                                                       04480049
      *                                                                 04490000
           Move  R115IRP0-In-Contract-No To    WE-Contract-No           04500050
      *                                                                 04510000
      *    If we want related party independant of relation, we can't   04520019
      *    use these fields in the qualification.                       04530019
           Evaluate True                                                04540019
             When R115IRP0-In-Rel-MC                                    04550019
               Move  Space               To    WE-CA-Currency           04560019
               Move  +0000               To    WE-From-PA-Seq-No        04570019
               Move  +0000               To    WE-To-PA-Seq-No          04580019
                                                                        04590019
             When R115IRP0-In-Rel-Any                                   04600019
               Move  Space               To    WE-CA-Currency           04610019
               Inspect WE-CA-Currency                                   04620019
                   Converting '* '                                      04630019
                   To         '%%'                                      04640019
               Move  +0000               To    WE-From-PA-Seq-No        04650019
               Move  +9999               To    WE-To-PA-Seq-No          04660019
                                                                        04670019
             When R115IRP0-In-PA-Seq-No  =     +0                       04680019
               Move  R115IRP0-In-CA-Currency                            04690019
                                         To    WE-CA-Currency           04700019
               Move  +0                  To    W-Tally                  04710030
