                                         Converting '* ' to '%%'        04750030
               End-If                                                   04760030
               Move  +0001               To    WE-From-PA-Seq-No        04770019
               Move  +9999               To    WE-To-PA-Seq-No          04780019
                                                                        04790019
             When other                                                 04800019
