                                         To    WE-CA-Currency           04820019
               Move  +0                  To    W-Tally                  04830030
               Inspect WE-CA-Currency   Tallying W-Tally for all '*' '%'04840030
               If  W-Tally               >     +0                       04850030
                   Inspect WE-CA-Currency                               04860030
                                         Converting '* ' to '%%'        04870030
               End-If                                                   04880030
               Move  R115IRP0-In-PA-Seq-No                              04890019
                                         To    WE-From-PA-Seq-No        04900019
