           If  W-Tally                   >     +0                       04990031
               Inspect WE-Role-Type      Converting '* ' to '%%'        05000031
           End-If                                                       05010031
      *                                                                 05020000
           Move  R115IRP0-In-Customer-ID To    WE-Customer-ID           05030045
