           Move  WE-Contract-No          To    W-DB-Contract-No         05260050
      *                                                                 05270000
           Move  WE-CA-Currency          To    W-DB-CA-Currency         05280019
           Move  WE-From-PA-Seq-No       To    W-DB-From-PA-Seq-No      05290019
           Move  WE-To-PA-Seq-No         To    W-DB-To-PA-Seq-No        05300019
