      *################################################################.06780000
       E100-Check-Qualification          Section.                       06790000
      *                                                                 06800000
      * We use the WE-fields for comparison with the WS-fields.         06810000
      * This to verify that the qualification has not changes since     06820000
      * the Get-1st.                                                    06830000
      *                                                                 06840000
           Evaluate True                                                06850000
             When WE-Key                 =     WS-Key                   06860000
             and  WE-Code-Sequence       =     WS-Code-Sequence         06870000
             and  WS-Cursor-OK                                          06880000
               Continue                                                 06890000
      *                                                                 06900000
             When WE-Key                 =     WS-Key                   06910000
             and  WE-Code-Sequence       =     WS-Code-Sequence         06920000
             and  WS-Cursor-End                                         06930000
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    06940000
               Move  'DB-LEST-SISTE'     To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  06950000
               Move  'VAR1'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)06960000
               Move  W-Table-Name        To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)06970000
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               06980000
