                   Move  'DB-FOREKOMST-NF'                              07380000
                                         To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  07390000
                   Move  'VAR1'          To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)07400000
                   Move  W-Table-Name    To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)07410000
                   Perform Z000-Error-Message                           07420000
                 Else                                                   07430000
                   Initialize                  R7918030-ErrorMessage    07440000
                   Move  'DB-LEST-SISTE' To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  07450000
                   Move  'VAR1'          To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)07460000
                   Move  W-Table-Name    To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)07470000
