      *################################################################.07580000
       F000-Select                       Section.                       07590000
      *                                                                 07600000
           Perform F100-Prepare-Qualification                           07610000
      *                                                                 07620000
      * We will first look through the storage, to see if we have       07630000
      * already got the wanted occurence.                               07640000
      *                                                                 07650000
           Perform L200-Find-DCL                                        07660000
      *                                                                 07670000
      * If we didn't find anything, we need to read. Then we store.     07680000
      *                                                                 07690000
           If  Ind-WS                    >     W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab         07700000
           or  WS-DB2-Not-Read (Ind-WS)                                 07710000
               Perform F200-Select-Row                                  07720000
               Perform L100-Store-DCL                                   07730000
           End-If                                                       07740000
      *                                                                 07750000
      * At last we check what we've got to offer.                       07760000
      *                                                                 07770000
           Evaluate True                                                07780000
             When WS-DB2-Read (Ind-WS)                                  07790000
               Move  WS-DB2-DCL (Ind-WS) To    DCLTF-Related-Party      07800000
               Perform J000-Get-Columns                                 07810000
      *                                                                 07820000
             When other                                                 07830000
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    07840000
               Move  'DB-FOREKOMST-NF-Q' To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  07850000
               Move  'VAR1'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)07860000
               Move  W-Table-Name        To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)07870000
               Move  'VAR2'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (2)07880000
               Move  FK-OAKO-FinInst-ID  To WD-Fin-Inst-ID              07890000
               Move  FK-TFMC-Contr-No    To WD-Contract-No              07900000
               Move  FK-TFPA-Seq-No      To WD-PA-Seq-No                07910019
               String WD-Fin-Inst-ID           Delimited by size        07920000
                      '/'                      Delimited by size        07930000
                      FK-TFMC-Contr-Type       Delimited by space       07940000
                      WD-Contract-No           Delimited by size        07950000
                      '/'                      Delimited by size        07960000
                      FK-TFCA-Currency         Delimited by space       07970019
                      WD-PA-Seq-No             Delimited by size        07980019
                      '/'                      Delimited by size        07990019
                      FK-KFTY-Role-Type        Delimited by space       08000019
                                       Into R7918030-In-Variable-Data(2)08010000
               End-String                                               08020000
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               08030000
               Set   R7919999-Return-Error                              08040000
                                         To    True                     08050000
      *                                                                 08060000
           End-Evaluate                                                 08070000
      *                                                                 08080000
           .                                                            08090000
