           Set   R115IRPS-In-Delete      To    True                     11400000
           Move  R115IRP0-In-Table-Version                              11410036
                                         To    R115IRPS-In-Table-Version11420036
      *                                                                 11430000
           Call  'F115IRPU'              Using R115IRPS-SQL-Submodules  11440000
                                               DCLTF-Related-Party      11450000
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      11460000
           End-Call                                                     11470000
      *                                                                 11480000
           Evaluate True                                                11490000
             When R7919999-Return-OK                                    11500000
               Continue                                                 11510000
      *                                                                 11520000
             When R7919999-Return-Error                                 11530000
               Continue                                                 11540000
      *                                                                 11550000
             When other                                                 11560000
               Move  'I201'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       11570000
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       11580000
      *                                                                 11590000
           End-Evaluate                                                 11600000
      *                                                                 11610000
           .                                                            11620000
      *################################################################.11630000
       J000-Get-Columns                  Section.                       11640000
