           Perform J100-Move-DCL-To-Output                              11660000
      *                                                                 11670000
           .                                                            11680000
      *################################################################.11690000
       J100-Move-DCL-To-Output           Section.                       11700000
      *                                                                 11710000
      * PLEASE REMEMBER:                                                11720032
      *    When you modify the code in this section, you need to do     11730032
      *    the same modifications in module F115ARP0 - E500-section.    11740032
      *                                                                 11750032
           Move  FK-OAKO-FinInst-ID      To    R115IRP0-Fin-Inst-ID     11760000
           Move  FK-TFMC-Contr-Type      To    R115IRP0-Contract-Type   11770000
           Move  FK-TFMC-Contr-No        To    R115IRP0-Contract-No     11780000
           Move  FK-TFCA-Currency        To    R115IRP0-CA-Currency     11790019
           Move  FK-TFPA-Seq-No          To    R115IRP0-PA-Seq-No       11800019
           Move  FK-KFTY-Role-Type       To    R115IRP0-Role-Type       11810019
      *                                                                 11820002
           Move  FK-KLID-Cust-ID         To    R115IRP0-Customer-ID     11830002
           If  FK-KLID-Cust-ID           >     +0                       11840014
               Move  FK-KLID-Cust-ID     To    W-Customer-ID            11850014
               Perform N400-Fetch-Customer-No                           11860014
               Move  W-Customer-No       To    R115IRP0-Customer-No     11870014
           End-If                                                       11880014
      *                                                                 11890014
           Move  FK-KFRO-SEQ-NO          To    R115IRP0-KFRO-Seq-No     11900034
      *                                                                 11910034
           Move  TFRP-Account            To    R115IRP0-Account         11920034
           Move  TFRP-Account2           To    R115IRP0-Account-2       11930034
      *                                                                 11940034
           Move  TFRP-Reference          To    R115IRP0-Reference       11950002
      *                                                                 11951051
           Move  FK-OAKO-FinInst-ID      To    W-Fin-Inst-ID            11970000
           Perform N200-Fetch-Fin-Inst-No                               11980000
           Move  W-Fin-Inst-No           To    R115IRP0-Fin-Inst-No     11990000
      *                                                                 12000000
      * Info about the cursor:                                          12010000
      *                                                                 12020000
           Move  WC-Row-No               To  R115IRP0-Out-Row-No        12030000
           Move  WC-Total-No-Of-Rows     To  R115IRP0-Out-Total-Rows    12040000
      *                                                                 12050000
           .                                                            12060000
      *################################################################.12070000
       L100-Store-DCL                    Section.                       12080000
      *                                                                 12090000
      * We might already have this row in storage.                      12100013
      *                                                                 12110013
           Perform L200-Find-DCL                                        12120013
      *                                                                 12130013
           If  Ind-WS                    >     W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab         12140013
           or  WS-DB2-Not-Read (Ind-WS)                                 12150013
             Then                                                       12160013
      *        If we have reached the end of the storage-table,         12170013
      *        we start on the beginning.                               12180013
      *        This way, we always keep the "newest" occurrences.       12190013
               Add   +1                  To    Ind-WS-Put               12200013
               If  Ind-WS-Put            >     W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab         12210013
                   Move  +1              To    Ind-WS-Put               12220013
               End-If                                                   12230013
               Move  Ind-WS-Put          To    Ind-WS                   12240013
             Else                                                       12250013
               Move  Ind-WS              To    Ind-WS-Put               12260013
           End-If                                                       12270013
      *                                                                 12280013
      * We store the identification.                                    12290000
      *                                                                 12300000
           Move  R115IRP0-In-Table-Version                              12310036
                                         To    WS-DB2-Tbl-Version       12320036
                                                            (Ind-WS-Put)12330036
           Move  FK-OAKO-FinInst-ID      To    WS-DB2-Fin-Inst-ID       12340000
                                                            (Ind-WS-Put)12350000
           Move  FK-TFMC-Contr-Type      To    WS-DB2-Contract-Type     12360000
                                                            (Ind-WS-Put)12370000
           Move  FK-TFMC-Contr-No        To    WS-DB2-Contract-No       12380000
                                                            (Ind-WS-Put)12390000
           Move  FK-TFCA-Currency        To    WS-DB2-CA-Currency       12400019
                                                            (Ind-WS-Put)12410019
           Move  FK-TFPA-Seq-No          To    WS-DB2-PA-Seq-No         12420019
                                                            (Ind-WS-Put)12430019
           Move  FK-KFTY-Role-Type       To    WS-DB2-Role-Type         12440019
                                                            (Ind-WS-Put)12450000
      *                                                                 12460000
      * The DCL is stored if found, the status is set.                  12470000
      *                                                                 12480000
           Evaluate True                                                12490000
             When Length                 Of    DCLTF-Related-Party      12500000
                > Length                 Of    WS-DB2-DCL               12510000
               Move  Length              Of    DCLTF-Related-Party      12520000
                                         To    WD-Length                12530000
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    12540000
               Move  'GL-WL-DCL-UTVIDES' To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  12550000
               Move  'VAR1'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)12560000
               Move  WD-Length           To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)12570000
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               12580000
               Move  'L101'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       12590000
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       12600000
      *                                                                 12610000
             When R7919999-Return-Error                                 12620000
               Set   WS-DB2-Not-Found (Ind-WS-Put)                      12630000
                                         To    True                     12640000
      *                                                                 12650000
             When other                                                 12660000
               Move  DCLTF-Related-Party                                12670000
                                         To    WS-DB2-DCL   (Ind-WS-Put)12680000
               Set   WS-DB2-Read (Ind-WS-Put)                           12690000
                                         To    True                     12700000
      *                                                                 12710000
           End-Evaluate                                                 12720000
      *                                                                 12730000
           .                                                            12740000
      *################################################################.12750000
       L200-Find-DCL                     Section.                       12760000
      *                                                                 12770000
           Perform Varying Ind-WS                                       12780000
                   From  +1              By    +1                       12790000
                   Until Ind-WS          >     W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab         12800000
                   or  ( WS-DB2-Tbl-Version (Ind-WS)                    12810036
                                         =     R115IRP0-In-Table-Version12820036
                     and WS-DB2-Fin-Inst-ID (Ind-WS)                    12830036
                                         =     FK-OAKO-FinInst-ID       12840000
                     and WS-DB2-Contract-Type (Ind-WS)                  12850000
                                         =     FK-TFMC-Contr-Type       12860000
                     and WS-DB2-Contract-No (Ind-WS)                    12870000
                                         =     FK-TFMC-Contr-No         12880000
                     and WS-DB2-CA-Currency (Ind-WS)                    12890019
                                         =     FK-TFCA-Currency         12900019
                     and WS-DB2-PA-Seq-No (Ind-WS)                      12910019
                                         =     FK-TFPA-Seq-No           12920019
                     and WS-DB2-Role-Type (Ind-WS)                      12930019
                                         =     FK-KFTY-Role-Type )      12940019
           End-Perform                                                  12950000
      *                                                                 12960000
           .                                                            12970000
      *################################################################*12980000
       L300-Remove-DCL                   Section.                       12990000
      *                                                                 13000000
           Perform Varying Ind-WS                                       13010000
                   From  +1              By    +1                       13020000
                   Until Ind-WS          >     W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab         13030000
                   or  ( WS-DB2-Tbl-Version (Ind-WS)                    13040036
                                         =     R115IRP0-In-Table-Version13050036
                     and WS-DB2-Fin-Inst-ID (Ind-WS)                    13060036
                                         =     FK-OAKO-FinInst-ID       13070000
                     and WS-DB2-Contract-Type (Ind-WS)                  13080000
                                         =     FK-TFMC-Contr-Type       13090000
                     and WS-DB2-Contract-No (Ind-WS)                    13100000
                                         =     FK-TFMC-Contr-No         13110000
                     and WS-DB2-CA-Currency (Ind-WS)                    13120019
                                         =     FK-TFCA-Currency         13130019
                     and WS-DB2-PA-Seq-No (Ind-WS)                      13140019
                                         =     FK-TFPA-Seq-No           13150019
                     and WS-DB2-Role-Type (Ind-WS)                      13160019
                                         =     FK-KFTY-Role-Type )      13170019
           End-Perform                                                  13180000
      *                                                                 13190000
           Evaluate True                                                13200000
             When Ind-WS                 >     W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab         13210000
               Continue                                                 13220000
      *                                                                 13230000
             When other                                                 13240000
               Initialize                      WS-DB2-Row (Ind-WS)      13250000
      *                                                                 13260000
           End-Evaluate                                                 13270000
      *                                                                 13280000
           .                                                            13290000
      *################################################################*13300000
       N100-Fetch-Fin-Inst-ID            Section.                       13310000
      *                                                                 13320000
           Move  W-Fin-Inst-No (1:4)     To    W-Tmp-Konsern-Nr         13330000
      *                                                                 13340000
           If  Not R5879010-Versjon                                     13350000
           or  R5879010-In-Konsernnr     Not = W-Tmp-Konsern-Nr         13360000
      *                                                                 13370000
               Initialize                      R5879010-Konsern         13380000
               Set   R5879010-Versjon    To    True                     13390000
               Set   R5879010-In-Select  To    True                     13400000
               Move  W-Tmp-Konsern-Nr    To    R5879010-In-Konsernnr    13410000
               Call  'F5879010'          Using R5879010-Konsern         13420000
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      13430000
               End-Call                                                 13440000
               If  Not R7919999-Return-OK                               13450000
                   Move  'N101'          To    R7919999-Paragraph       13460000
                   Perform Z900-Abend                                   13470000
               End-If                                                   13480000
      *                                                                 13490000
           End-If                                                       13500000
      *                                                                 13510000
           Move  R5879010-Ut-KO-Konsern-Id                              13520000
                                         To    W-Fin-Inst-ID            13530000
      *                                                                 13540000
           .                                                            13550000
      *################################################################*13560000
       N200-Fetch-Fin-Inst-No            Section.                       13570000
      *                                                                 13580000
           If  Not R5879010-Versjon                                     13590000
           or  R5879010-In-Konsern-ID    Not = W-Fin-Inst-ID            13600000
      *                                                                 13610000
               Initialize                      R5879010-Konsern         13620000
               Set   R5879010-Versjon    To    True                     13630000
               Set   R5879010-In-Select  To    True                     13640000
               Move  W-Fin-Inst-ID       To    R5879010-In-Konsern-ID   13650000
               Call  'F5879010'          Using R5879010-Konsern         13660000
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      13670000
               End-Call                                                 13680000
               If  Not R7919999-Return-OK                               13690000
                   Move  'N201'          To    R7919999-Paragraph       13700000
                   Perform Z900-Abend                                   13710000
               End-If                                                   13720000
      *                                                                 13730000
           End-If                                                       13740000
      *                                                                 13750000
           Move  R5879010-Ut-KO-Konsernnummer                           13760000
                                         To    W-Tmp-Konsern-Nr         13770000
           Move  W-Tmp-Konsern-Nr        To    W-Fin-Inst-No            13780000
      *                                                                 13790000
           .                                                            13800000
      *################################################################*13810001
       N300-Fetch-Customer-ID            Section.                       13820001
      *                                                                 13830001
           If  W-Fin-Inst-No             =     Space                    13840001
           and W-Fin-Inst-ID             Not = +0                       13850001
               Perform N200-Fetch-Fin-Inst-No                           13860001
           End-If                                                       13870001
      *                                                                 13880001
           Move  W-Fin-Inst-No (1:4)     To    W-Tmp-Konsern-Nr         13890001
      *                                                                 13900001
           If  Not R1781910-Versjon                                     13910001
           or  R1781910-In-Konsern-Nr    Not = W-Tmp-Konsern-Nr         13920001
           or  R1781910-In-Kunde-Nr      Not = W-Customer-No            13930001
      *                                                                 13940001
               Initialize                      R1781910-Kunde-ID        13950001
               Set   R1781910-Versjon    To    True                     13960001
               Set   R1781910-In-Select  To    True                     13970001
               Move  W-Tmp-Konsern-Nr    To    R1781910-In-Konsern-Nr   13980001
               Move  W-Customer-No       To    R1781910-In-Kunde-Nr     13990001
               Call  'F1781910'          Using R1781910-Kunde-ID        14000001
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      14010001
               End-Call                                                 14020001
      *                                                                 14030001
      * We may have received a customer-no that does not exist in       14040014
      * FD Customer, therefore we must accept Return-Error.             14050014
               Evaluate True                                            14060014
                 When R7919999-Return-Abend                             14070014
                   Move  'N301'          To    R7919999-Paragraph       14080001
                   Perform Z900-Abend                                   14090001
                 When R7919999-Return-Error                             14100014
                   Move  +0              To    R1781910-Ut-Kunde-ID     14110014
                   Set   R7919999-Return-OK                             14120014
                                         To    True                     14130014
               End-Evaluate                                             14140015
      *                                                                 14150001
           End-If                                                       14160001
      *                                                                 14170001
           Move  R1781910-Ut-Kunde-ID    To    W-Customer-ID            14180001
      *                                                                 14190001
           .                                                            14200001
      *################################################################*14210001
       N400-Fetch-Customer-No            Section.                       14220001
      *                                                                 14230001
           If  Not R1781910-Versjon                                     14240001
           or  R1781910-In-Kunde-ID      Not = W-Customer-ID            14250001
      *                                                                 14260001
               Initialize                      R1781910-Kunde-ID        14270001
               Set   R1781910-Versjon    To    True                     14280001
               Set   R1781910-In-Select  To    True                     14290001
               Move  W-Customer-ID       To    R1781910-In-Kunde-ID     14300001
               Call  'F1781910'          Using R1781910-Kunde-ID        14310001
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      14320001
               End-Call                                                 14330001
      *                                                                 14340001
               If  Not R7919999-Return-OK                               14350001
                   Move  'N401'          To    R7919999-Paragraph       14360001
                   Perform Z900-Abend                                   14370001
               End-If                                                   14380001
      *                                                                 14390001
           End-If                                                       14400001
      *                                                                 14410001
           Move  R1781910-Ut-Kunde-Nr    To    W-Customer-No            14420001
      *                                                                 14430001
           .                                                            14440001
      *################################################################*14450001
       ZI00-Conv-Input-Version           Section.                       14460008
      *                                                                 14470000
      * Version control.                                                14480000
      * If conversion is needed, we call the conversion module.         14490000
      *                                                                 14500000
           Set   R115IRP0-Version        To    True                     14510000
           Move  Length                  Of    R115IRP0-Related-Party   14520000
                                         To    W-IO-Length              14530000
      *                                                                 14540000
           Evaluate True                                                14550000
             When L-Ext-IO-Area (1:8)    =     R115IRP0-Version-No      14560000
             and  Length                 Of    L-Ext-IO-Area            14570000
                                         Not < W-IO-Length              14580000
               Move  L-Ext-IO-Area (1:W-IO-Length)                      14590000
                                         To    W-Int-IO-Area            14600000
      *                                                                 14610000
             When Other                                                 14620000
               Call  'F115I999'                                         14630000
                   Using By Content      'F115IRP0 '                    14640000
                                         'INPUT '                       14650000
                         By Reference    L-Ext-IO-Area                  14660000
                                         W-Int-IO-Area                  14670000
                                         R7919999-Error-Area            14680000
               End-Call                                                 14690000
      *                                                                 14700000
               If  R7919999-Return-Abend                                14710000
                   Move  'ZI03'          To    R7919999-Paragraph       14720000
                   Perform Z900-Abend                                   14730000
               End-If                                                   14740000
      *                                                                 14750000
           End-Evaluate                                                 14760000
      *                                                                 14770000
           .                                                            14780000
      *################################################################*14790000
       ZO00-Conv-Output-Version          Section.                       14800008
      *                                                                 14810000
      * Version control.                                                14820000
      * If conversion is needed, we call the conversion module.         14830000
      *                                                                 14840000
           Evaluate True                                                14850000
             When L-Ext-IO-Area (1:8)    =     R115IRP0-Version-No      14860000
             and  Length                 Of    L-Ext-IO-Area            14870000
                                         Not < W-IO-Length              14880000
               Move  W-Int-IO-Area       To    L-Ext-IO-Area            14890000
                                                         (1:W-IO-Length)14900000
      *                                                                 14910000
             When Other                                                 14920000
               Call  'F115I999'                                         14930000
                   Using By Content      'F115IRP0 '                    14940000
                                         'OUTPUT '                      14950000
                         By Reference    L-Ext-IO-Area                  14960000
                                         W-Int-IO-Area                  14970000
                                         R7919999-Error-Area            14980000
               End-Call                                                 14990000
      *                                                                 15000000
               If  R7919999-Return-Abend                                15010000
                   Move  'ZO01'          To    R7919999-Paragraph       15020000
                   Perform Z900-Abend                                   15030000
               End-If                                                   15040000
      *                                                                 15050000
           End-Evaluate                                                 15060000
      *                                                                 15070000
           .                                                            15080000
      *################################################################*15090000
       Z000-Error-Message                Section.                       15100000
      *                                                                 15110000
           Set   R7918030-Version        To    True                     15120000
      *                                                                 15130000
           Move  'TF'                    To    R7918030-In-System-ID    15140000
           Move  R115X000-Fin-Inst-No    To    R7918030-In-Fin-Inst-No  15150000
           Move  R115X000-FI-Language-639-1                             15160000
                                         To    R7918030-In-Language     15170000
           If  R115X000-Trace-On                                        15180003
               Set   R7918030-In-Log-Yes To    True                     15190003
           End-If                                                       15200003
      *                                                                 15210000
           Call  'F7918030'              Using R7918030-ErrorMessage    15220000
           End-Call                                                     15230000
      *                                                                 15240000
           Move  R7918030-Out-MessageText                               15250000
                                         To    R7919999-Message         15260000
      *                                                                 15270000
           .                                                            15280000
      *################################################################*15290000
       Z900-Abend                        Section.                       15300000
      *                                                                 15310000
           If  R7919999-Return-Code      Not   Numeric                  15320000
           or  Not R7919999-Return-Abend                                15330000
               Move  +0                  To    R7919999-Module-Ind      15340000
           End-If                                                       15350000
      *                                                                 15360000
           Add   +1                      To    R7919999-Module-Ind      15370000
      *                                                                 15380000
           If  R7919999-Module-Ind       Not >                          15390000
                             ( Length    Of    R7919999-Module-Tab      15400000
                             / Length    Of    R7919999-Module-Element )15410000
               Move  'F115IRP0'          To    R7919999-Module-Name     15420000
                                                   (R7919999-Module-Ind)15430000
               Move  R7919999-Paragraph  To    R7919999-Module-Para     15440000
                                                   (R7919999-Module-Ind)15450000
           End-If                                                       15460000
      *                                                                 15470000
           Set   R7919999-Return-Abend   To    TRUE                     15480000
      *                                                                 15490000
           Goback.                                                      15500000
